                  {
                    "value": "Go deeper",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "14pt",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#1478BE"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• The page buttons at the top right move between the scorecard pages.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Right-click a KPI and choose Drill through › KPI detail for its trend, hospitals and definition.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• On KPI detail, select a hospital and month in the table, then Open detail for the detail page behind it.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Back (top left) returns to the page you came from.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Hospital comparison: click a pillar header to see its objectives, then an objective header to see its KPIs; the path above the table goes back up.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Owner view: click an owner's card to list only their KPIs; click it again to list everyone.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Hover over a KPI for its actual, target, variance and owner.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
